      "id": "claim_b0819b80d7c2484c9200a7f268b9d20e",
      "statement": "Test types have standardized naming: unit tests (*.unit.test.ts) for isolated fast tests with mocked dependencies; integration tests (*.integration.test.ts) for real Postgres via Testcontainers with real module wiring and selective mocks; end-to-end tests (*.end-to-end.test.ts) for the full application stack (rare); and packed tests (*.packed.test.ts) run by the separate end-to-end target against installed tarballs.",
