      "statement": "Tests are executed via Nx targets per project: nx run <project>:vitest:unit, nx run <project>:vitest:integration, nx run <project>:vitest:end-to-end, and nx run <project>:end-to-end for packed tests. The standard CI and local validation command is nx affected --target=vitest --base=main which runs all vitest configurations for affected projects and their dependents.",
