      "id": "claim_2467739c5be74373891dba069f1b19cb",
      "statement": "Coverage practices: after structural refactors always re-run coverage; if branch coverage is below threshold, add focused tests for uncovered guard and fallback branches first; use a hotspot-first loop; raise coverage with behavior-first assertions, not synthetic inflation; keep Vitest configs thin, inheriting from configuration/typescript/vitest.config.ts via mergeConfig; run the CI-shaped command locally before a PR: nx affected --target=vitest --configuration=coverage --base=main.",
