    {
      "id": "claim_eec9c2ace7564ab083aebcef83ab1cdf",
      "statement": "Mocking uses @golevelup/ts-vitest's createMock<T>() for all injectable classes/interfaces, returning fully-typed DeepMocked<T> with every method as vi.fn() and properties recursively mocked via Proxy. Manual stub objects are forbidden. Mocks declared at describe scope with let, instantiated in beforeAll/beforeEach via module.get().",
